1000000037},{"file":"C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\f217d2c49402f7c6.wav","t":8.347765199999998},{"file":"C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\c690611bc6170f06.wav","t":12.559802699999999},{"file":"C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\18806b637430b02f.wav","t":16.423239099999996},{"file":"C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\14c62a1b9c87d1b4.wav","t":20.886328},{"file":"C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\e0d1097cd3002fb4.wav","t":24.734161699999994},{"file":"C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\3164d3b34f243fa3.wav","t":29.977371399999996},{"file":"C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\b6caab901e39186b.wav","t":33.18770430000001},{"file":"C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\c94c9ec316d1b24a.wav","t":37.0167326},{"file":"C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\92fa034707be1641.wav","t":39.44253459999999},{"file":"C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\ccac871845e209a2.wav","t":44.273612299999996},{"file":"C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-1\\voice\\eedf9059a330df93.wav","t":46.512154499999994}],"captions":[{"text":"In this video, we'll set up Job Explorer from scratch, and go all the way to your first list of AI-scored jobs.","start":0.3536391000000023,"end":7.081324500000001},{"text":"The first time you open Job Explorer, a short setup walks you through it.","start":8.347769499999998,"end":12.3771323},{"text":"It starts by explaining how your information is handled.","start":12.559810599999999,"end":15.5580231},{"text":"Your profile, resumes, and applications stay on your computer, encrypted.","start":16.423244599999997,"end":20.702914799999995},{"text":"There's no account, and nothing is sent to the app's maker.","start":20.8863373,"end":23.874510199999996},{"text":"When the AI scores a job, only what it needs is sent, like the posting and your skills.","start":24.734167,"end":29.797790899999995},{"text":"Your name and contact details are removed first.","start":29.9773778,"end":33.000797899999995},{"text":"With local AI, nothing leaves your computer at all.","start":33.18770909999999,"end":36.15577209999999},{"text":"And Job Explorer never applies for you.","start":37.0167393,"end":39.26199729999999},{"text":"You apply on the employer's own site, then mark the job as applied.","start":39.44254199999999,"end":43.40796569999999},{"text":"You can also choose the app's language here.","start":44.2736163,"end":46.3329325},{"text":"Let's get started.","start":46.5121637,"end":47.641806999999986}]}